sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant Web
  participant API
  participant Auth
  participant DB
  participant Cache
  participant Queue
  participant Mailer
  actor Admin
  User->>Web: open
  Web->>API: request
  API->>Auth: verify
  Auth-->>API: ok
  API->>Cache: get
  Cache-->>API: miss
  API->>DB: query
  DB-->>API: rows
  API->>Queue: enqueue
  Queue->>Mailer: send
  Note over API,DB: slow path
  Mailer-->>Admin: report
